    "description": {
      "value": "Three faintly glowing wisps of fire float around your head.\n\nEach time you hit a creature with a Strike, one of the wisps goes hurtling towards that creature, dealing 1d4 fire damage. If you Cast a Spell with the fire trait while you have fewer than three wisps, a new wisp appears."
